@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:お前たちだって<br>魔法を使えるというだけで<br>迫害にあったことも<br>あるはずだ！|#0205Trial16_AnAn002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ただ人より少しだけ<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_16_02\">優れていた</link>だけなのに、<br>どうしてわがはいたちが<br>虐げられなければならない！|#0205Trial16_AnAn003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Cry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ならばそんな<br>愚かな奴らの目がない分、<br>監獄の中の方が<br>幾分か<link=\"Objection_02_05_16_03\">マシ</link>なのではないか？|#0205Trial16_AnAn004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"外への未練など<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_16_04\">過去</link>に縛られている者の<br>妄言に過ぎない！|#0205Trial16_AnAn005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

